<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-BANKING ASSOCIATION ISSUES 2004 BONDS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-BANKING ASSOCIATION ISSUES 2004 BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Banking Association said on Friday that it has issued 2.637 million kroons in bonds to finance the purchase of new offices.</p>
<p>It was the second issue to finance the investment, a spokesperson added.</p>
<p>The yield on the bonds is 12 percent and they will be redeemed on March 28 in 2004.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
